#: ui/pages/pipeline_config_page.py:183
msgid ""
"Machine-learning defaults (<code>model</code>, <code>data</code>, "
"<code>training</code>, <code>paths</code>, "
"<code>text_classification</code>). Save writes to your active pipeline file,"
" or to <code>pipeline.yaml</code> beside <code>application.yaml</code> in "
"app data when only packaged defaults are loaded."
msgstr ""
"Machine-Learning-Standardwerte (<code>model</code>, <code>data</code>, "
"<code>training</code>, <code>paths</code>, "
"<code>text_classification</code>). Beim Speichern wird in die aktive "
"Pipeline‑Datei geschrieben oder, falls nur paketierte Vorgaben geladen sind,"
